From bdaa0516c171ad3421581291844e14a182292ac8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 23:32:46 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(sync): stop match feeds from wiping stored player
 headshots; repair roster sync SQL
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Match-summary and squad-roster upserts now coalesce headshot_url so a NULL
in one ESPN feed no longer overwrites a photo the other stored, and the
rosters command was dead SQL (a SELECT alias referenced inside WHERE) —
it now runs off a derived table, restoring the photos ESPN does provide.

🤖 Generated with Codebuff
Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
