 own-goal fix
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Card rows now draw the actual booking at a glance — yellow, red, or the
stacked yellow-over-red pair for a second yellow — instead of a stroke
icon. Substitutions render ESPN's documented on/off order (participants[0]
came on, [1] went off) with a volt ▲ on the on-player and a danger ▼
against the off-player, replacing the direction-agnostic ⇄. Own goals
checked before the assist branch, so a two-participant own goal no longer
labels its second name "Assist".

